cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "NisslQuant: semi-automated quantification of dark-stained area in Nissl-stained histological sections"
abstract: "A Python tool that quantifies the dark-stained area fraction in Nissl-stained sections using dual-reference optical-density calibration, multi-scale density decomposition and an error-rate-controlled threshold, with per-image confidence intervals and quality control."
